# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything here is a leak if committed. The repo holds the TEMPLATE only.
#
# The template is safe because scan_pii.py gates it. A built index.html is not:
# it embeds one person's identity, their book, and whatever POV notes they
# added. Same for the config. Same for the source artifact this template was
# generated from.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Personal config and built output
command-center.config.json
*.config.json
!plugins/command-center/skills/command-center/reference/config.example.json

# Built command centers — anything index.html that is not a template.
# `build/` is listed explicitly: the bare `index.html` patterns did not match
# build/test-index.html, so `make check` output would have been committable.
build/
index.html
**/index.html
!plugins/command-center/skills/command-center/template/index.html.tmpl

# The personal source artifact the template is derived from
ae-command-center.html
ae-command-center*.html
command-center-app.html

# Curated account intelligence — never shareable
pov-data.json
pov-data*.json
linkedin-data*.json
*-pov.json

# Manually pasted analytics rows (personal performance data)
hpf-*.json
HPF-SCORECARD.md

# Editor and OS noise
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
